WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.834 --> 00:00:03.868
-So, after the draft decision --

00:00:03.868 --> 00:00:05.834
the draft decision
overturning Roe v. Wade

00:00:05.834 --> 00:00:07.133
was leaked last month,

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:10.000
we wrote a sketch
and we filmed it last week,

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.434
because unlike, I don't know,
the Democratic leadership,

00:00:12.434 --> 00:00:13.767
we saw this coming.

00:00:13.767 --> 00:00:17.200
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.167
So...here's our sketch
that we filmed last week

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:24.000
from "Late Night" writer
Jeff Wright.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.234
-As you all know,
there's been a leaked draft,

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.367
and one of us is on it.
-A draft? Are we going to war?

00:00:28.367 --> 00:00:30.834
-No, a drafted proposal
to overturn one of us.

00:00:30.834 --> 00:00:32.167
-Damn, that's sad.

00:00:32.167 --> 00:00:34.167
Well, sorry to see you go,
Loving v. Virginia.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.501
Interracial marriage
had its run.

00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:36.734
-What? Interracial marriage?

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:38.067
I'm all about how love
doesn't see color.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.400
-Yeah, but we don't need a law
to prove that anymore.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.100
The Kardashians
already solidified that.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:44.067
-Well, then get rid of
Obergefell v. Hodges

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:46.167
and gay marriage.
-What? Gay marriage? No way.

00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:47.701
I'm all about love, too.

00:00:47.701 --> 00:00:48.968
Plus I'm the newest,

00:00:48.968 --> 00:00:50.734
and I was passed
while Obama was in office.

00:00:50.734 --> 00:00:52.901
They wouldn't want to
get rid of something Obama did.

00:00:52.901 --> 00:00:54.634
-If you ask me,
I think it's Roe v. Wade.

00:00:54.634 --> 00:00:56.901
-What makes you say that?
-Well, because it says here,

00:00:56.901 --> 00:00:58.834
"Draft to overturn Roe v. Wade."
-What?

00:00:58.834 --> 00:00:59.801
-Damn.
-I knew it was him.

00:00:59.801 --> 00:01:01.267
-Wait, you made us guess

00:01:01.267 --> 00:01:03.133
when you had it on your phone
this whole time?

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:05.300
-Hey, man. Let's focus
on Roe v. Wade

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:07.834
and them possibly
overturning abortions.

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.567
-To think they're okay with
overturning a woman's

00:01:09.567 --> 00:01:12.000
constitutional right is just...
-Just wrong.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.033
-Terrible.
-[Bleep] up.

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:15.901
Hey, but, Roe,
we gonna hold it down in here.

00:01:15.901 --> 00:01:17.601
-What do you mean hold it down?

00:01:17.601 --> 00:01:19.234
The way I see it
is if I get overturned,

00:01:19.234 --> 00:01:20.968
we're all getting overturned.
-Overturned with you?

00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:22.367
I didn't get that notification
on my phone.

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:23.534
-Don't need to.

00:01:23.534 --> 00:01:26.033
The way I see it is if I'm gone,
nobody's safe.

00:01:26.033 --> 00:01:28.567
Yes, abortions now, but next
it'll be gay marriage.

00:01:28.567 --> 00:01:29.968
-Oh, don't say that.

00:01:29.968 --> 00:01:31.267
-Then it'll be
interracial marriage.

00:01:31.267 --> 00:01:32.934
-Man, I just want to love
white people. Is that wrong?

00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:34.901
-Whoa.
-What? Love is love.

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:37.367
-Yeah, love is love, but chill.
-Next they'll take away

00:01:37.367 --> 00:01:39.234
my constitutional right
to have guns.

00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:41.434
-You know damn well they're
not doing anything about guns.

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.300
-You right.
Well, I guess I'll just

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:44.767
get back to ordering more guns.

00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:46.701
Oh, shoot. There's a
two-for-one. Anybody want one?

00:01:46.701 --> 00:01:48.467
-But they'll overturn
everything else.

00:01:48.467 --> 00:01:50.133
Next thing you know, they'll
segregate our schools again.

00:01:50.133 --> 00:01:52.267
-Come on, now. Not the kids.

00:01:52.267 --> 00:01:54.167
Times have changed.
-Have they, though?

00:01:54.167 --> 00:01:56.667
I mean, people are still getting
chastised for how they look,

00:01:56.667 --> 00:01:59.334
who they love, or what they
want to do with their bodies.

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:00.634
-You got a point.

00:02:00.634 --> 00:02:01.834
What should we do?
-Ooh.

00:02:01.834 --> 00:02:03.200
What if when they come
for Roe v. Wade

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.000
we turn off all the lights
and pretend we aren't here?

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.434
-Man, how would that even work?

00:02:06.434 --> 00:02:08.133
-They would just
turn the lights back on.

00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:10.634
-I was just trying to help.
-The best we can do

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:12.567
is stick tog--
-Shh! You heard that?

00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:13.601
I think someone's going.

00:02:13.601 --> 00:02:14.501
-I'm not going out
without a fight.

00:02:14.501 --> 00:02:15.901
-I'll get the lights.

00:02:15.901 --> 00:02:17.934
♪♪

00:02:17.934 --> 00:02:19.801
[ Door creaks ]

00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:22.534
-Huh. I guess Roe v. Wade
isn't here.

00:02:22.534 --> 00:02:24.567
♪♪

00:02:24.567 --> 00:02:26.501
-Huh? Huh?

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:29.267
See? I told you turning
off the lights would work.

00:02:29.267 --> 00:02:31.133
-He's -- He's right behind you.
He's right behind --

00:02:31.133 --> 00:02:33.434
-He's right behind me, isn't he?

00:02:33.434 --> 00:02:34.701
Aw, [bleep].

00:02:34.701 --> 00:02:35.801
-Y'all sure
y'all don't want a gun?

